text.en:
In addition to the powers and functions of the National Coal Authority provided in Presidential Decree
No. 1722, the Authority shall also exercise the following powers:
(a) To succeed in its corporate name, with the power of succession;
(b) To sue and be sued in such corporate name;
(c) To adopt, alter and use a corporate seal, which shall be of judicial notice;
(d) To adopt, amend, and repeal its by-laws;
(e) In general, to carry on any activity and to have and exercise all of the powers conferred by law on private
corporations.
